    "en": "Straight leg, pull it in toward your standing leg"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cue2",
   "primary": false,
   "text": {
    "zh": "带子拴在牢靠的低处，椅子只用来扶。",
    "en": "Anchor the band low on something solid. The chair is just for balance."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cue3",
   "primary": false,
   "text": {
    "zh": "慢慢放回去，两边胯骨一样高。",
    "en": "Let it back out slowly, both hip bones level."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cue4",
   "primary": false,
   "text": {
    "zh": "一边做完，绑带换到另一只脚，转过身再做。",
    "en": "When one side is done, move the strap to the other ankle and turn around."
   }
  }
 ],
